<title>POLAND: POLISH PEPEES SHARES ALLOTTED AT PLN 120.</title>
<headline>POLISH PEPEES SHARES ALLOTTED AT PLN 120.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food producer PEPEES SA shares were allotted at a special Warsaw bourse session on Monday at 120 zlotys, 20 percent above their minimum issue price, and buy orders were reduced, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The price was set at 120 zlotys...and the average rate of allotment was at 46.4 percent,&quot; Adam Maciejewski told Reuters.</p>
<p>The company, which offered 152,100 shares last week, will start regular bourse trade on the main market on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
